    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d101-a1">

                <pb facs="0194" n="114" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg114"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Dickerson, Brown &amp; Raegener to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-10-01"><hi rendition="#italic">October 1,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In the name of our client, Mr. H. A.
                    Thomsen, and in our own behalf, we hereby express our thanks to the Department
                    of State and to the United States minister to Brazil for their prompt and
                    energetic assistance, without which a settlement would have been impossible and
                    but for which a valuable business would have been ruined.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dickerson, Brown &amp;
                        Raegener.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
